Subject: dt-bindings: timer: thead,c900-aclint-mtimer: Add SpacemiT K3

From: Junhui Liu <junhui.liu@pigmoral.tech>

[ Upstream commit 73329198cdc273008bd273b0c5ad4c65251cb49e ]

Add support for the SpacemiT K3 ACLINT MTIMER, which provides per-hart
timer interrupts in Machine mode.

